  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $y=-3$ and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|2y+7{|}^{6} & = \\\\ |2(-3)+7{|}^{6} & = \\\\ |-6+7{|}^{6} & = \\\\ |1{|}^{6} & = \\\\ {1}^{6} & = \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
